<section class="bg-[#0b2545] pt-16 pb-24 px-4 md:px-12 relative overflow-hidden text-white border-b border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
    <div>
      <div class="text-[#F59E0B] font-semibold text-sm mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">bolt</span>
        SISTEMA POS OFFLINE-FIRST
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Tu negocio no se detiene. Tu sistema tampoco.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 mb-8 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Arcom es el único POS que funciona 100% sin internet. Sigue facturando, controlando inventario y atendiendo clientes aunque se caiga la red. La tranquilidad de un sistema robusto, con la agilidad de la nube.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a class="bg-[#10B981] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-center hover:bg-emerald-600 transition-all duration-200 h-[56px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg hover:scale-105" href="#download">
          Empezar ahora — instalación en 3 minutos
        </a>
        <a class="border border-white/30 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-center hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors h-[56px] flex items-center justify-center gap-2" href="#demo">
          Ver cómo funciona <span class="material-symbols-outlined">play_arrow</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 w-full p-2 ring-1 ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-t-xl text-xs font-mono">
          <div class="flex gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500 inline-block"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 inline-block"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-2 text-slate-400">Arcom POS v2 — Terminal Local</span>
        </div>
        <img
          alt="Arcom POS Terminal Real"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-b-xl border border-slate-800"
          src="/screenshots/pos-light.png"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
